  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evacuating Orphans &amp; Families, Bringing Aid</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kidsave&apos;s evacuated 30,000+ orphans and others from Ukrainian war zones and has brought 1,000 tons of humanitarian aid to Ukrainians caught in the war. Current needs are immense, with daily trips in, but we are also preparing for a time of healing. We are the building a retreat in western Ukraine to bring war trauma training and therapy to Ukrainian kids and families, lodging, skills-building for young adults, a summer camp and other services plus space and time for connection and healing.</narrative>
  </description>
